# MIG Master

> Gaming controllers, Switch accessories, and MIG Flash hardware for lawful personal cartridge collection workflows.

MIG Master offers gaming controllers, Switch and Switch 2 accessories, projection cables, portable charging gear, and MIG Flash hardware. Its MIG Flash V2 and MIG Flash Dumper are presented for lawful personal cartridge collection workflows, with hardware only and no games, licenses, or protected materials included.

## Pages

- [MIG Master](https://migmaster.shop/a/shop/) — MIG Master is the official online store.

## Products

- [Mig Flash Dumper USB-C Cartridge Reader](https://migmaster.shop/a/shop/products/mig-flash-dumper) — The Mig Flash Dumper USB-C Cartridge Reader is a hardware accessory designed for use with a supported computer. The package contains Mig Flash Dumper hardware, with no games or software licences included.
- [Aolion Wireless Controllers for Switch and OLED](https://migmaster.shop/a/shop/products/aolion-joy-con) — Aolion Wireless Controllers for Switch and OLED are Aolion wireless replacement gaming controllers offered by MIG Master for Switch and OLED consoles. Buyers should confirm the console model, connection requirements, and package contents before ordering.
- [Mig Flash V2 Cartridge Management Accessory](https://migmaster.shop/a/shop/products/mig-flash-v2) — Mig Flash V2 Cartridge Management Accessory is a hardware accessory for cartridge management with a top-mounted physical selection button. Mig Flash V2 Cartridge Management Accessory is supplied as hardware only and does not include a microSD card or a Dumper.
- [NEWDERY 10000mAh Battery Case for Switch 2](https://migmaster.shop/a/shop/products/portable-charger-case-for-nintendo-switch-2-10000mah-external-rechargeable-battery-pack-with-foldable-stand-and-2-game-card-storage) — The NEWDERY 10000mAh Battery Case for Switch 2 combines a rated 10000mAh battery with an adjustable stand and storage for two game cards. The NEWDERY 10000mAh Battery Case for Switch 2 connects through USB-C and displays the remaining battery percentage on an LED display.
- [AOLION K20 Hall Effect Wireless Controller](https://migmaster.shop/a/shop/products/game-controller) — The AOLION K20 Hall Effect Wireless Controller is a gaming controller with Hall Effect sticks, analog triggers, mechanical ABXY buttons, programmable back controls, and wired, Bluetooth, and receiver connection options.
