- [NS1 to NS2 Controller Mount Adapter](https://migmaster.shop/a/shop/products/switch2-adapter) — The NS1 to NS2 Controller Mount Adapter attaches NS1 controllers to an NS2 console for a handheld setup.
- [GameSir G7 Pro Tri-Mode Controller](https://migmaster.shop/a/shop/products/gamesir-g7-pro-tri-mode-xbox-pc-android-controller) — The GameSir G7 Pro Tri-Mode Controller is a gaming controller for Xbox, PC, and Android, with platform-specific wired, wireless, and Bluetooth connectivity.
